<title>HONG KONG: Kumho Merchant Bank sets US$50 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Kumho Merchant Bank sets US$50 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating rate certificate of deposit issue was announced by arranger KDB UK.</p>
<p>BORROWER  KUMHO MERCHANT BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT    US$50 MLN   COUPON    6ML+60 BP   MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	FRCD	  ISS PRICE PAR	   LAUNCH    17.OCT.96</p>
<p> PUTS	YR 3	  CALLS     YR 3	  REPLIES   30.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING   NONE	  REPAYMENT BULLET	DENOMS    US$500K</p>
<p> RATINGS   NONE	  SALE LMTS STANDARD    TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG   YES	   CRS DEF   YES	   FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY S.KOREA     GOV LAW   ENGLISH     PAY DATE  13.NOV.96</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	     CO-LEAD MANAGERS US$4 MLN+   63 BP ALL-IN 81 BP</p>
<p>	     SENIOR MANAGERS  US$2-3 MLN  60 BP ALL-IN 80 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGERS KDB UK, KOOKMIN FINANCE HONG KONG, SUMITOMO FINANCE</p>
<p>	     ASIA, BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AND ING BARINGS</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
